      "field": "priceNote",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8b6f8f597b00ec4521c853146915ff45519d0860f877d7a51981589d26a67f60",
      "text": "From $5346 per person sharing a double or triple room on the three-star package. Four-star package: $5611 per person in a double or triple room. Minimum two participants. New Year departure supplement: $250 net per person.",
